  "title": "NetworkOnlyPolicy",
  "description": "Always fetches, and neither reads nor writes any cache. For sources that must always be fresh - a live configuration file, a server-authoritative manifest - and for environments where persistence is unwanted. It writes nothing: a policy named network-only that still filled a cache would leave records no policy on the same route ever reads.",
